<title>NETHERLANDS: GEVEKE DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>GEVEKE DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</headline>
<text>
<p>AMSTERDAM, April 28 Reuter) - Technical services group Geveke NV said on Monday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 70 held.</p>
<p>In March, Geveke announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 2.70 guilders, up from 2.30 in the previous year. The 1997 payment could be taken up in cash or as an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Geveke's shares closed at 79.50 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Monday, up 0.50 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
